<title>HUNGARY: Egis Q1 '97 after-tax profit HUF 1.796 bln.</title>
<headline>Egis Q1 '97 after-tax profit HUF 1.796 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  1,563.3    vs   1,529.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    1,796.7    vs   1,651.9</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		  1,796.7    vs   1,651.9</p>
<p>    Net sales revenue		 6,899.6    vs   6,125.7</p>
<p>	Domestic sales		  3,498.5    vs   4,036.2</p>
<p>	Export sales		    3,401.1    vs   2,089.5</p>
<p>    Other revenue			 182.6    vs     135.0</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	   2,121.6    vs   1,827.2</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales	 3,010.4    vs   2,643.4</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		  387.0    vs     260.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income	     190.8 profit vs 132.5 profit</p>
<p>	 Financial revenue		199.8    vs     160.1</p>
<p>	 Financial expenditure	    9.0    vs	27.7</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	   42.6 profit vs   9.8 loss</p>
<p>	 Extraordinary revenue	   69.7    vs	 0.0</p>
<p>	 Extraordinary expenditure     27.1    vs	 9.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Egis Gyogyszergyar Rt is a pharmaceuticals company, majority owned by France's Servier S.A.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327-4040</p>
